<title>USA: Florida university sets MERCOSUR graduate studies.</title>
<headline>Florida university sets MERCOSUR graduate studies.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida International University said on Monday it was establishing a graduate studies program for issues related to the MERCOSUR trade grouping.</p>
<p>The program, which will offer a graduate certificate, will likely start in January and arises from an agreement between Florida International and MERCOSUR, the university said.</p>
<p>-- Miami newsroom, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
